teness Not Guaranteed:\nSet appears populated with nine specimens as photographed, but original factory completeness cannot be confirmed.\nStorage Wear:\nLight rubbing and handling wear visible on specimens and packaging components.\nUsed AS-IS:\nItem is offered in used condition as pictured. Only the mineral specimens, capsule, box, tray, and instruction sheet shown in the photographs are included.",
